BT 1 0 0 1 0 228.6 Tm 1.0386 Tw 10.8 TL /F4 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Abstract) Tj /F3 9 Tf (\227Airline reservation depends on several interdependent) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.241 Tw (activities: discovering flights, recording passenger information,) Tj T* 0 Tw 8.433 Tw (issuing booking references, producing tickets, handling) Tj T* 0 Tw .344571 Tw (cancellations and maintaining schedules. When these are handled) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.850143 Tw (manually or through poorly coordinated tools, records become) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.708857 Tw (inconsistent, booking references are hard to trace and) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.71125 Tw (administrators lack a reliable view of operations. This paper) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.161 Tw (presents the design of SkyTech Airlines, a centralized Java web) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.383714 Tw (application that addresses these problems within an academic) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.424714 Tw (scope. The system recognizes two roles \(Passenger and) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.955429 Tw (Administrator\) and divides the work into five modules:) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.948 Tw (authentication and user management, flight search and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.902 Tw (availability, booking and passenger management, ticketing and) Tj T* 0 Tw 7.2378 Tw (cancellation, and administrative flight management. The) Tj T* 0 Tw .498 Tw (architecture combines JavaServer Pages, Jakarta Servlets, JDBC) Tj T* 0 Tw .466 Tw (and a MySQL database on Apache Tomcat 10.1, with server-side) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.09 Tw (role-based access control, salted password hashing, parameterized) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.342857 Tw (SQL and transactional booking and cancellation. The paper) Tj T* 0 Tw 10.3428 Tw (reports the requirements specification \(42 functional) Tj T* 0 Tw .995143 Tw (requirements\), architecture, data model and verification plan. It) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.311714 Tw (describes planned capabilities only; no implementation or test) Tj T* 0 Tw (result is claimed.) Tj T* ET
